# Editor / tooling backups (MCPB_PACKAGING_STANDARDS.md section 2.4;
# single source of truth here — Step 3 of the pack pipeline syncs this file
# to mcpb/.mcpbignore, so rules removed here vanish from the pack root too)
*.bak
*.bak.*
*.bak-*
*.orig
*.rej

# Pack build tooling itself -- not runtime code (basename globs: match at any depth)
pack.ps1
verify_pack.py
mcpb-pack.ps1
